<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $82-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $82-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-1/16 at $82-5/8 in New York on Monday and soon eased further to $82-1/2.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 449.60 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
